2766330/extras/9ebf6dbee3e9cdaa3a166f686661c2d4.mp4?t=1786473780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Collapse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you manage to break the simulation? Now you’ll have to face the General to escape the laboratory. Get ready to solve new puzzles with fresh mechanics while enemies and turrets hunt you down without mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who relish strategic challenges and intense adventures will be able to overcome this final trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist and join the Visitor Program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/c88699c3f1f0b16c208b6f1490106b3c.poster.avif?t=1786473780\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/c88699c3f1f0b16c208b6f1490106b3c.webm?t=1786473780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/c88699c3f1f0b16c208b6f1490106b3c.mp4?t=1786473780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted puzzles: clever and challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative: who can you really trust?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden notes with revealing information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action sequences that shift the pace of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist and join the Visitor Program.</strong> <br><b